SY_TALK("l9IRdwtklzc",[[5,["Guru Puja. Cabella Ligure, July16th 1995"]],[262,["It is a very important Guru Puja today"]],[272,["because we have completed twenty-five","years of Guru Puja."]],[287,["(Hindi: \"Please put the fan in the rotating","manner\".)"]],[315,["Also, it is extremely beautiful"]],[324,["to see so many Sahaja Yogis who are,","really have become, very great."]],[339,["It’s a question of understanding what","Sahaja Yoga is."]],[347,["It's a very unique discovery, I feel now,"]],[352,["that people who were seeking the Truth","have found it"]],[362,["and have now got it absolutely on their","central nervous system."]],[374,["Yes, in some places it’s difficult to","explain"]],[378,["how it has happened, how it has worked out"]],[382,["and how, in these twenty-five years, we","have been able"]],[386,["to achieve this expansion of Sahaja Yoga."]],[396,["The main thing, I feel, is that you all","should know"]],[405,["that as the tree grows, the roots have","to grow much deeper"]],[412,["and they should spread also. If it doesn't","happen,"]],[417,["the tree cannot be sustained only by Mother","Earth."]],[423,["So the roots are in your own life, in your","own heart."]],[434,["When we say we have become our own Guru,"]],[438,["we should really try to find out with our","introspection:"]],[444,["Are we our Guru or not?"]],[450,["Because, before this your mind was on one","side"]],[456,["and your heart was on another side"]],[466,["and your attention was in another","dimension."]],[472,["So these three things were creating","confusion within you."]],[487,["If you understand a human being, then you","will be surprised to see"]],[494,["how these three things act separately in a","human being. And sometimes they fight also."]],[503,["First is your intellect and your mind."]],[507,["Second is your heart, your feelings, your","emotions."]],[522,["And the third one is your attention."]],[532,["In these modern times, this confusion is","the worst"]],[538,["because all the time your attention is","outside."]],[543,["It could be towards beautiful things, or","beautiful women, or beautiful men or"]],[550,["all kinds of nonsensical way of wasting","your energy."]],[557,["Such attention then is absolutely like","a horse which is let loose."]],[563,["You cannot control such an attention."]],[566,["And this attention runs wild from one","to another."]],[574,["It’s a fashion also. It’s sort of a very","popular thing"]],[578,["to keep the attention moving all the time."]],[583,["But this attention that has to be towards","the Divine,"]],[589,["towards the Almighty, is just being","frittered away."]],[597,["Thus, attention doesn’t grow its own roots."]],[606,["First is to find out about yourself: where","does your attention go?"]],[611,["What makes you feel like looking after or","concerned for attention?"]],[624,["You see, the attention comes from various","problems,"]],[629,["and could be your upbringing where you are","not controlled,"]],[644,["could be your education, could be your","atmosphere in which you live"]],[654,["or could be your own ego or your","conditioning."]],[662,["(Hindi: \"The water is maybe a bit too cold,","that's why."]],[675,["What is it, tea? Is it hot?"]],[682,["Pour it here, I'll drink it."]],[696,["That's fine\".)"]],[702,["So, this attention is being attacked"]],[711,["by all these outside energies or negative","forces"]],[723,["and it gets entangled - like a river","flowing"]],[730,["straight into the ocean can get lost","in a barren place."]],[740,["In the same way this attention, which has","to go towards the Divine,"]],[750,["gets frittered away and is vanished..."]],[754,["This weak attention cannot take you towards","the Divine."]],[760,["Ultimately you find that all this attention","is being completely"]],[768,["absorbed or frittered away by the nonsense","that’s going on."]],[775,["Unfortunately or fortunately, you are born","in these modern times,"]],[781,["and in these modern times, as you know,","it's a very chaotic condition."]],[786,["In these chaotic conditions, you don’t know","what is right and what is wrong."]],[791,["And there are all kinds of attractions,"]],[797,["which can take away your attention and","reduce the energy of your attention."]],[807,["It is possible more for the people who are","very right-sided."]],[815,["Also the left-sided people can be very much","affected."]],[819,["Right-sided people, as you know, go up to","a point and become extremely dry,"]],[824,["self-opinionated and aggressive. All their","attention is in aggression,"]],[832,["while the people who are on the left side","are indulging too much"]],[838,["into their own whims and their desires and","their own temptations."]],[846,["Both sides can fritter away your attention"]],[850,["which is the most important thing. It is","the most valuable thing is your attention."]],[857,["But the attention cannot be controlled by","a person"]],[862,["who doesn't have a weak mind or a weak","heart."]],[870,["Now supposing you take somebody who is","a very intelligent person."]],[875,["The intelligent person puts all his","attention"]],[879,["in capturing the attention of others."]],[884,["I don't know why, but it’s a kind of","a paradox."]],[888,["The person who himself is having such a lot","of aggressiveness and all that,"]],[899,["tries to be very sweet, tries to be very","nice with people"]],[903,["just to keep good relations or, we can say,","the good behavior"]],[912,["towards people so that they pay attention","to that person."]],[917,["This is a very subtle thing. They are not","even aware about it,"]],[921,["that we do such a thing just to make others","pay attention to us."]],[929,["That is how we have seen that in these","modern times"]],[933,["so many stupid things people do just","to attract the attention of others."]],[939,["Most of the fads that had come up in modern","times"]],[948,["are just to make something stupid so that","people should pay attention to them."]],[958,["Of course, the Sahaja Yogis are not like","that. But I am just pointing it out"]],[963,["how, in the modern times, you have to be","very careful"]],[967,["that you should not try to attract","the attention of others."]],[973,["Instead of that, what you have to do is","to pay attention to others"]],[979,["in a very subtle way, not with any","expectation"]],[983,["that if you are paying attention to","somebody,"]],[985,["that person should pay attention to you.","It’s a very big struggle,"]],[991,["I’ve seen, in Sahaja Yoga also, that people","try to, say, become very popular"]],[999,["or become very outstanding, or something","of a very great qualities,"]],[1007,["to show off that they are something better","than others."]],[1012,["A person who is really in connection with","the Divine, is least bothered"]],[1018,["about how people pay attention to that","person,"]],[1023,["but automatically the attention of such","a person is on others,"]],[1030,["which is very, very subtle, very subtle."]],[1033,["You cannot make out that the attention","of such a person"]],[1037,["is on you, but it works and it works","beautifully."]],[1044,["We have to understand that we have now come","to the realm of the Divinity."]],[1049,["We are in the Kingdom of God and we are","divine people."]],[1054,["We are very powerful people, but if we","fritter away"]],[1059,["our attention, we become very, very weak","people."]],[1063,["It's easy to feel that, “we are Sahaja","Yogis”, “we have done"]],[1069,["so much of realisation of others” or","“we have helped so many people.”"]],[1075,["All this consciousness if it comes within","you, then know"]],[1079,["that you are still not fully developed","Sahaja Yogis."]],[1084,["There should be no consciousness of what","you are doing or what you are committing."]],[1090,["There is no need to boast about it. There","is no need to advertise it."]],[1098,["Whatever you are, is already, can be seen","by everyone."]],[1102,["But even that desire is not needed"]],[1106,["because you are doing just for","the satisfaction of your Spirit."]],[1113,["So then, when we come to our heart:"]],[1118,["in the heart resides the Spirit, as you","know very well."]],[1121,["Now, when it is the heart, which has","to work over your brain and which can work,"]],[1129,["what becomes of you is nothing, but you","become a source"]],[1134,["of love and compassion. A source, I am","saying."]],[1138,["You do not assert on others. You do not say","that, “I’ve done so much for you"]],[1143,["and what are you doing to me? What is this","that I should have so much expressed,"]],[1153,["in so many ways, and here you are,"]],[1156,["you are forgetting me and not doing","anything for me?”"]],[1160,["So the expectation of reward if it is","there,"]],[1166,["then you must know is your mind which is","giving you these ideas"]],[1171,["and is working it out that way that you","just now put attention"]],[1177,["to the amount of love the other person","has given you"]],[1181,["for whatever you have given to another","person. It's very subtle."]],[1191,["So in Sahaja Yoga, you should see now","yourself as just a source of love,"]],[1198,["which is just flowing."]],[1202,["In that, you do not say that you have","to have this or that,"]],[1208,["or you have to achieve this goal, or you","have to become that. It's finished now."]],[1215,["Once you have become the source, then how","can you become something?"]],[1222,["The thing is, those who are receiving from","the source want to have"]],[1229,["some sort of a reward or some sort of","a recognition."]],[1241,["In this subtle way if you move, your mind","is very clever."]],[1247,["In Sahaja Yoga, we have very clever,","intelligent people."]],[1252,["But this mind... You have to be very","careful because this mind can cheat you."]],[1262,["So ask your mind, \"Why are you in Sahaja","Yoga?"]],[1267,["What is the purpose of your Sahaja Yoga?\""]],[1272,["Gradually this mind will shut up. And then,","you have to ask yourself that,"]],[1281,["\"What is my own desire now? What do I want?"]],[1289,["What do I want to achieve? Why I am","in Sahaja Yoga?\""]],[1297,["If you ask this question, you will see","you’ll just dissolve,"]],[1301,["you'll become thoughtless because there is","no desire left now."]],[1307,["There is no ambition left, no competition."]],[1311,["All these qualities are of the brain, or we","can say, of the intellect,"]],[1316,["which makes you competitive, which makes","you also jealous."]],[1322,["So jealousy is also a product of this","competitiveness"]],[1326,["because when two persons are competing","or many are competing"]],[1331,["and one is selected, others become jealous."]],[1335,["I mean, instead of feeling happy, \"All","right. So, one of us has become something,"]],[1341,["so we should be very happy that he has","become.\""]],[1343,["On the contrary, the other people feel","jealous, \"Why has he become?"]],[1349,["Who is he? What does he think of himself?\"","Then they go further."]],[1353,["Not you people, but on the whole, people","go further with it"]],[1358,["and what do they do is to harm another","person."]],[1364,["In Sahaja Yoga, people are also sometimes","very worried and frightened."]],[1370,["There is no need to be worried or","frightened"]],[1373,["because now you have become a Sahaja","Yogi and a Guru. Nobody can touch you."]],[1380,["Anybody who tries to touch you will be","subsided, somehow or other."]],[1387,["Of course, I don't do anything as such.","But today only I heard that in Turkey"]],[1393,["there were two newspapers who were after","Sahaja Yoga, writing all nonsensical things."]],[1399,["So, the first one met with an accident and","died. I didn't do that."]],[1407,["The second one had two people, editor","and sub-editor,"]],[1412,["were killed and somebody cut their throats.","Of course, I didn't do that."]],[1418,["Some fundamentalist must have done, or","somebody must have done."]],[1421,["Now, we don't have to worry as to who","criticizes you, they say it about you"]],[1426,["because you must know they are blind","people."]],[1429,["They are absolutely blind, they are not","matured as far as the wisdom is concerned."]],[1435,["For them to understand Sahaja Yoga is not","possible."]],[1439,["They go up to a point and then they stop.","They cannot go further"]],[1443,["because this dissolution of your being,"]],[1446,["as I said, “the drop becomes the ocean”."]],[1453,["It's difficult, specially in the West,","where there are so many ideas"]],[1458,["of their own identifications and of their","own personalities."]],[1467,["Now, it is quite, again, a paradox that we","don’t want people"]],[1474,["to dress up indecently or we don’t want","people to behave indecently."]],[1481,["Decency is a very big part of Sahaja Yoga."]],[1485,["So one can ask that, \"Mother, when you say","you have to completely dissolve,"]],[1491,["then why should we have this dignity?"]],[1494,["Why should we worry about having","the dignity?\" It's quite all right."]],[1498,["This question is all right. The answer is","like this:"]],[1501,["Supposing, you put a drop of some filth in","the ocean, then the ocean can become dirty."]],[1514,["If you put some poison, then the whole","ocean can become poisonous."]],[1519,["In the same way, whatever is not congenial","to the ocean,"]],[1526,["to this Divine power, should not be done."]],[1531,["Otherwise, you will spoil the whole of it.","We have had experiences."]],[1538,["We have had Sahaja Yogis who were leaders","also,"]],[1542,["and they tried to be quite funny and","the whole collectivity was spoilt."]],[1548,["One person who is not a good person can","spoil the whole collectivity."]],[1554,["The one who is then a leader, on top","of that, is even worse."]],[1561,["So, one has to understand that, when you","are becoming a drop of the ocean,"]],[1568,["this ocean is the pure ocean of love."]],[1573,["In that you should not do something that","will create repulsion, frustration,"]],[1580,["or even sometimes it can create a very","grotesque image of the whole ocean."]],[1589,["That is why we have to be decent people,","decorous people."]],[1594,["It is not that in any way we want you to be","like a dandy people or anything,"]],[1601,["but what it means that you must respect","your body, respect yourself"]],[1607,["and a respectable personality you should","have."]],[1611,["Too much indulgence to that is not proper,"]],[1615,["but it should be such that you should","respect yourself."]],[1619,["It's very important. If you cannot respect","yourself"]],[1623,["you cannot respect at all the Divinity","within you."]],[1629,["It's like a decoration of the Divinity that","your whole behavior,"]],[1635,["your whole attire has to be in such a way","that people should know"]],[1640,["that he is a decent man."]],[1643,["Indecent things have come out and have","become now an everyday fashion."]],[1650,["And they go on coming one after another","because of the entrepreneurs,"]],[1654,["and we are playing into the hands","of entrepreneurs."]],[1656,["But if you know what dress you have to wear"]],[1660,["and what is good for you, once for all you","have to decide."]],[1663,["Now the attention should not be also wasted"]],[1667,["in that, \"I will today, I'll wear this kind","of a sari,"]],[1670,["tomorrow I’ll wear that kind of a dress,","third day…\","]],[1674,["because that also spoils the attention.","But if it is a decent thing,"]],[1679,["it's perfectly alright, and that will","really make you feel"]],[1683,["dignified within yourself."]],[1686,["In modern times, as the people are, I don't","think"]],[1689,["they have much respect for themselves."]],[1693,["You see very highly posted people, highly","placed people"]],[1697,["doing all kinds of nonsensical things like","cheating,"]],[1701,["like having relations with people who are","of dishonorable position."]],[1712,["All this is happening. If you see","in the newspaper, you are shocked"]],[1715,["how these people at the helm of affairs","could be like this."]],[1720,["Because they are still not matured enough","to know where are they,"]],[1725,["what is their position, how they have","to be."]],[1728,["If you are matured enough then you will","understand that, say, I’m a housewife,"]],[1732,["I’m such a minister, I’m prime-minister,","how I should be."]],[1737,["That all that achievement they have outside","remains outside, doesn't go inside."]],[1743,["But for a Sahaja Yogi it should be absorbed","within."]],[1747,["It has to be absorbed within so that","the attention is not wasted too much."]],[1757,["The another part which one has to see is","the heart."]],[1763,["Some people are saying, \"Mother, if our","heart is ruling the head,"]],[1772,["then we become too much emotional, we get","too much attached to people,"]],[1777,["we get, you see, sort of individual","friendships and things like that.\""]],[1786,["On this point, one has to know that why do","you get attached to one person?"]],[1792,["It’s not your heart. It’s not your heart.","You get attached to a person"]],[1799,["because you have some sort of a, we can","say, a relationship, maybe."]],[1807,["Or maybe, you like the hair-dress of that","person."]],[1811,["Maybe, you like the dress that person has."]],[1815,["Something outside quality is attracting you","towards that person."]],[1821,["It is not something inner quality that is","attracting."]],[1825,["For example, if you are attached to your","children too much, you will spoil them."]],[1831,["They will not come up to your expectations.","Anybody you get attached to,"]],[1836,["you must verify, why are you attached","to such a person, what is the reason?"]],[1842,["Now, in Sahaja Yoga people are attached","to each other very much, I know that."]],[1848,["But it is not for any external reason.","Because somebody is rich,"]],[1854,["because somebody is famous, because","somebody is doing"]],[1857,["some sort of a extraordinary work. No."]],[1862,["They are attached to that person because","that person is a bundle of vibrations,"]],[1871,["that it gives you tranquillity, it gives","you joy and it gives you"]],[1876,["a kind of an immense dissolution of your","being."]],[1884,["So, that happens when you are very much","there,"]],[1888,["as I have told you the story of once this","potter"]],[1894,["was kneading the clay and his name was","Gorakumhar,"]],[1903,["and when Namadeva, who was a tailor,"]],[1907,["but very well known poet, both of them","were poets, he went and he saw"]],[1913,["this potter was doing such a, I mean, it was","not a very respectable work he was doing,"]],[1920,["he was busy kneading the clay, he looked","at him and what he says that,"]],[1928,["\"I have come here to see the Chaitanya,","to see the formless."]],[1937,["But what I find that the formless has got","into a form.\""]],[1945,["This only, I always say, is only possible","between the two Saints of the same level."]],[1951,["That the way they appreciate, that the way","they feel -"]],[1956,["there are no words for what I want to say -","but the way they feel"]],[1960,["the oneness, the unity, which is a subtle","one between each other."]],[1966,["Such a feeling if you have for each other,","then know that you are"]],[1973,["really now dissolved and you are in","the ocean of joy."]],[1978,["But on the contrary, those who are sitting","on the shores cannot feel that way."]],[1984,["They judge, they try to find out what’s","wrong with that person, this is not so."]],[1989,["They can never appreciate another person.","What they feel is that they have a right"]],[1994,["to criticize, to find out faults with others","and that they are something special."]],[2000,["And the other person also finds some faults","with this person."]],[2003,["So it’s a fault-finding society I find","sometimes. And you get fed up with it."]],[2008,["But when you see that the another person","who is there,"]],[2013,["the person who is another saint, you feel","such rapport, such oneness,"]],[2023,["such a spontaneous feeling for that person","which is absolutely pure."]],[2029,["There’s no expectation, there’s no mental","activity to find out"]],[2036,["what’s wrong with that person. There’s no","judgment about what he, the person is like,"]],[2043,["but just oneness with that person you feel,","and you feel that your quality of your love"]],[2054,["has got a new shine, a new dimension."]],[2059,["So it comes to that, what we should","appreciate within ourselves"]],[2064,["is the purity of our love. When you are","pure, the purity is there,"]],[2071,["you do not get attached to anything, but","in that detachment, you are enjoying."]],[2080,["In attachment you cannot enjoy because","in that"]],[2086,["you are bothered more about the superficial","relationship with the other person."]],[2095,["Now, in a wider way, if you see Sahaja","Yoga,"]],[2098,["you are all very important people -","extremely important -"]],[2107,["because in the history of spirituality there","were not so many saints sitting together."]],[2114,["Never can you see so many people from so","many countries"]],[2118,["thinking about Divinity and morality."]],[2124,["It is impossible to get so many people","together, on any point whatsoever,"]],[2131,["who are feeling the oneness, the..."]],[2139,["you can say, the most soothing feeling","with each other."]],[2145,["Whether it is comfortable or not,"]],[2152,["whether it is very much according to","the norms of comfort,"]],[2162,["people who are saints are absolutely happy","with other saints"]],[2171,["and other saintly people. They rush","to people who are saints."]],[2177,["Once it happened to Me when I was","in Kolhapur"]],[2181,["that they told Me, “There is a saint who","talks about You.” “So where is he?”"]],[2185,["They said, “He lives up there and it will","take at least three hours"]],[2189,["for You to climb up. He only lives there,","he doesn't come out.”"]],[2193,["I said, \"All right, I would like to go and","see him.\""]],[2196,["So, I was walking and it started raining."]],[2202,["So they said, \"Mother, You never go","to anybody like that,"]],[2205,["why are You going to him?\" I said, \"No,","just I want to go up and see him.\""]],[2212,["Now, this fellow, they said, had a control","over rain,"]],[2216,["but it was raining, raining, raining very","heavily, and when I climbed up"]],[2224,["I saw him sitting down and going on like","this with great anger."]],[2229,["So, I said, \"Let us go and sit in his cave"]],[2235,["because this fellow is now not in a normal","mood.\""]],[2239,["So, I went and sat in the cave there, and","there he came. He couldn't walk"]],[2246,["because his... they say that his legs","became absolutely lame"]],[2252,["because of the vibrations that were too","much in him,"]],[2257,["whatever it is, he couldn't walk. So, they","brought him there, he sat down."]],[2263,["So, the first thing he asked Me, \"Why","did You not allow me to stop the rain?"]],[2269,["It was raining so heavily, and when You","were coming up,"]],[2275,["I didn’t want You to get drenched the way","now You are all full of water"]],[2281,["and I didn’t want You to suffer like this","because it’s not a good welcome to You."]],[2288,["So, did You do it just to control my ego,","because I must have developed ego"]],[2295,["because I can control rain, that's a fact?\""]],[2298,["So I just smiled at him. I said, \"See,"]],[2301,["you are My son, isn't it? And you have","bought a sari for Me."]],[2307,["But you are a sannyasi, so I can't take","a sari from you"]],[2310,["because sannyasi dharma is different -"]],[2312,["I'm a Gruhastha, I can't take a sari from","you."]],[2315,["So, I deliberately got drenched so that you","could give Me a sari.\""]],[2320,["The whole temper, the whole unnatural","behavior, all dropped out."]],[2326,["He became extremely sweet. \"Yes, yes,\"","he said, \"how do You know I bought a sari?\""]],[2330,["\"At least,\" I said, \"in love you know","everything.\""]],[2333,["And then he brought a sari for Me and he","did Aarti and everything."]],[2339,["But, you see, all these things show that","how the love masters everything so easily."]],[2346,["Small, small things, if you are expert","in expressing your love,"]],[2354,["how it works out. There are so many","incidents I can give you like this."]],[2360,["But the main thing we have to see within","ourselves, \"Do we really love each other?"]],[2369,["Do we really have affection and compassion","for others who are not even Sahaja Yogis?\""]],[2377,["Those who are not Sahaja Yogis are also","the blind people."]],[2382,["You should have compassion for them."]],[2387,["You should feel that these people are so","unhappy"]],[2391,["and they cannot come to Sahaja Yoga"]],[2395,["and they cannot become Sahaja Yogis,","and only in their ego they are satisfied."]],[2401,["So, you must have real compassion for them."]],[2404,["If you have this compassion you might be","told by people that,"]],[2410,["\"Why are you wasting your energy, you are","doing this, you are doing that?\""]],[2415,["The compassion is actually, unites all","these things within ourselves."]],[2421,["That’s the uniting factor. First is your","attention,"]],[2426,["first,  which is very, very important,","I think."]],[2431,["And the second one is your intellect, or","you can say your mind,"]],[2437,["and the third one is your heart. They all","get somehow or other united together"]],[2444,["once you have this capacity to have","compassion."]],[2448,["You don't quarrel with Me or anyone, you","don't have to think about it."]],[2451,["You just, you just feel absolutely at home","when you are compassionate"]],[2457,["and with this compassion, you are having","relations with others."]],[2461,["Now, this compassion is not studied out","or worked out or maneuvered."]],[2468,["It is just there. It is there. In that","compassion it forgives,"]],[2474,["it forgets all nonsensical things."]],[2477,["The forgiveness is only possible if you","have this compassion within you."]],[2483,["Now, even there are Sahaja Yogis who asked","me,"]],[2487,["\"Mother, how can we have love and","compassion?\""]],[2490,["I mean, this is a question which many have","asked me."]],[2496,["Now, the simple thing is that if you","develop your thoughtless awareness"]],[2502,["in your meditation, in thoughtless","awareness,"]],[2506,["you watch anything in thoughtless","awareness, any relationship you see it"]],[2511,["in thoughtless awareness, then you’ll be","amazed"]],[2515,["how the gates of this compassion will","open out."]],[2519,["Thoughtless awareness opens your heart,"]],[2523,["but it doesn't go to one person or","to another person,"]],[2528,["but it is throwing lights on all the sides","of your being."]],[2533,["Everybody is benefited, everybody has","a divine feeling for you."]],[2542,["Because this compassion is not linear,","nor is it aggressive, but it just flows"]],[2552,["and smoothes and soothes everything"]],[2556,["that is chaotic, that is troublesome and","that is painful."]],[2562,["This is what you have now."]],[2564,["You know, these things were done by saints","long time back."]],[2567,["But then nobody liked them, and they","crucified them - out of jealousy."]],[2571,["Because if somebody became a saint, then","people felt very jealous of that person."]],[2576,["So they killed them or tortured them and","troubled them."]],[2580,["The situation is not so bad now. Of course,","there are some useless people."]],[2585,["There are some people who are really","monsters, I agree. Forget about them."]],[2594,["But on the whole, our attitude should be","that these are blind people."]],[2601,["Now, looking at somebody who is, maybe,","something wrong with that person,"]],[2606,["may not be good-natured - may be anything.","But in your heart"]],[2610,["you should not have any grudge, you should","not have any complaints about them."]],[2616,["You can talk to that person about it. You","can tell him in a way that will be absorbed,"]],[2622,["but you should not try to make an issue","out of it"]],[2628,["and try to, in any way, trouble or torture","anyone."]],[2631,["(\"Can you put off this one?\" Hindi: \"Put","off the fan\".)"]],[2643,["You have seen already, in Sahaja Yoga,","those people who came and were troublesome"]],[2648,["and were not of any worth for us, just","dropped out by themselves."]],[2654,["We didn't have to do much about it. They","just dropped out"]],[2657,["and they have gone into some sort of","a problematic life."]],[2664,["I, even now, receive letters from them","saying that, “We have this problem,"]],[2667,["we have that problem and how to solve","this and solve that.\""]],[2671,["But it’s automatically happening because,","after all,"]],[2675,["there is a big choice going on and","the Divine s trying to decide"]],[2681,["who are capable of receiving the blessings","of the Divine."]],[2686,["This is the only thing you have to achieve."]],[2689,["That’s why you have come to Sahaja Yoga.","Nothing else is important."]],[2693,["There are people who are very highly","placed, tomorrow they go into dust."]],[2699,["There are people who are regarded as very","great, famous people,"]],[2704,["they go into dust. It's all the time is","happening in your presence."]],[2709,["Every day you read a newspaper and you","find how they are behaving."]],[2715,["Like today, somebody told Me that in","the newspaper there was there"]],[2720,["that now one bishop is going to discotheque,","can you imagine? He is going to a disco."]],[2728,["Now, what people must be thinking, they","must be breaking their heads,"]],[2732,["\"Now what to do, this stupid fellow whom","we call as the bishop and everything,"]],[2737,["is now going to disco.\""]],[2741,["What they, I mean, all whatever he had","respect,"]],[2745,["maybe it is artificial, but it’s all lost,","finished."]],[2749,["Because you see, as they are, they have","no value of themselves."]],[2756,["They just live with their ego, \"I am such","a big man. I am this, that. I am a bishop.\""]],[2761,["They walk in a different way, they talk","in a different way."]],[2764,["And suddenly how they go down."]],[2767,["Now, what was the need for this old Johnny"]],[2769,["to go to the discotheque, I can’t","understand?"]],[2772,["So, because of this kind of life that he","is leading, thinking no end of himself,"]],[2779,["he could never see that, “One day I will","go down like that.”"]],[2784,["Another thing, which you should see","in a very wider way,"]],[2787,["that he had no feeling why people respected","him."]],[2792,["He never knew why people had respect","for him."]],[2798,["Or he was not conscious of it. At least","he would have preserved that. He did not."]],[2805,["Why should he go to a place about which","he has been always denouncing"]],[2811,["and saying that these are bad places, one","should not go there?"]],[2818,["So, in your case, you have to be conscious","that you are Sahaja Yogis."]],[2825,["If you become the ocean doesn't mean that","your consciousness has vanished,"]],[2829,["but it has enlarged. You have got","the consciousness of the ocean."]],[2835,["You are not the one who has become like","a mesmerized person"]],[2841,["or a person who has no connection with","oneself."]],[2846,["On the contrary, you are connected with","yourself much more than you were before."]],[2852,["So, when you become the ocean you don't","loose your personality,"]],[2856,["but you expand your personality. You become","a greater person."]],[2860,["And this is happening in Sahaja Yoga. I am","noticing many people are developing"]],[2865,["that kind of a personality, and they are","expressing it and manifesting it."]],[2871,["It gives me great joy to see in My lifetime"]],[2874,["I could see such people who are doing this","kind of thing."]],[2880,["So, whenever you are doing something,","whatever is your enterprise,"]],[2885,["whatever your lifestyle, whatever it is,","that’s all outside."]],[2890,["One should not lose your attention, which","is towards God Almighty."]],[2898,["If that is lost, you are lost. There is","a very nice poem"]],[2902,["Namadeva has written about that there","was a boy who was flying a kite."]],[2910,["And the kite was floating, and this boy was","looking after the kite."]],[2915,["And while he was talking to everybody else,","but his attention was on the kite."]],[2920,["Then it goes further. He says that a lady","is having the little child"]],[2927,["on her body, on the waist, and she is","cleaning the house."]],[2934,["She is cleaning with a little broom. She","has to move"]],[2940,["from here to there and after that cleaning,","she has to do other work also."]],[2944,["But the child is here. So, her attention is","on the child"]],[2949,["that he should not fall down, something","should not happen."]],[2953,["Though she is doing all kinds of work,","everything,"]],[2957,["her attention is on the child. In the same","way, your attention should be"]],[2962,["on your Divine power of Kundalini."]],[2968,["There’s third one he’s described that there","are many ladies"]],[2972,["who are taking water from a river."]],[2976,["Sometimes they have three pitchers on their","heads and walking."]],[2980,["And while they are walking, they are","talking to each other,"]],[2984,["they are telling stories about each other","and anything,"]],[2986,["but their attention was on the pitchers,","which are on their head."]],[2991,["In the same way, whatever we are doing,","our attention"]],[2995,["should be on our Kundalini."]],[2999,["We should find out what are we doing.","As it is we have the light."]],[3005,["But you must take light into every corner","of your life,"]],[3011,["every aspect of your thinking, every kind","of an effort you make."]],[3020,["And you’ll be amazed, if you really watch","your attention"]],[3025,["you will really know what you are doing."]],[3028,["It’s the attention to be watched so much"]],[3031,["that ultimately you’ll be surprised that","the attention is no more frittering away."]],[3040,["Without the attention you cannot work out","Sahaja Yoga."]],[3045,["This is the main problem of Sahaja Yoga,","is that your attention has to be"]],[3051,["towards God Almighty. Otherwise, nothing","can work out."]],[3057,["Your ascent cannot work out. Hah, if you","have come to Sahaja Yoga"]],[3060,["to make money, all right, you will make","money and get out."]],[3063,["If you have come here to show off your","knowledge and all that,"]],[3067,["you will show it and get out. If you have","come here to show"]],[3071,["your power and your authority, you stay","there and get out."]],[3077,["Like that many people have gone out if you","know."]],[3080,["And this is what is to be really taken","care of: that you don’t try"]],[3087,["to use Sahaja Yoga for all these stupid","things,"]],[3091,["which are not permanent, which are not","eternal. Sahaja Yoga is to be used just"]],[3098,["for cleansing yourself, for becoming","the ocean, the ocean of love."]],[3107,["Now, many people also feel that love is","rather difficult,"]],[3114,["because you can be harmed by others, or","somebody can take advantage of you."]],[3122,["The main thing about love is, if it is not","a pure love, then it creates problems."]],[3129,["Supposing you trust somebody because","of money,"]],[3132,["trust somebody because of somebody…","relationship"]],[3135,["or anything, and you go on indulging","into it,"]],[3138,["ultimately you’ll find that you will be","very disappointed. Very disappointed."]],[3144,["But supposing you show your love, just","with purity about that person..."]],[3153,["It’s so subtle. It’s so innate within you,","built in. It’s there."]],[3163,["We have to just open out. Every human being","is a bundle of love."]],[3170,["And when he is afraid of others - specially","in the West,"]],[3174,["there is so many ideas they have created"]],[3176,["that you are afraid of this kind of love","and that kind of love and"]],[3182,["you see the way the perversion and","all nonsense is there."]],[3186,["But in pure love there is a kind of","a beautiful light"]],[3193,["which protects you, which guides you and","which enlightens your life completely."]],[3201,["This light is just nourished and also, we","can say, like the lamp has to have the oil,"]],[3212,["this is the one that is for our","spirituality: the Love of a person."]],[3220,["You are embodiment of love, take it from","Me, because you are a human being."]],[3224,["Even the animals are there who know what","is love is."]],[3229,["You see… I know that if you love a tiger,","the tiger will never harm."]],[3236,["If you love a snake, it will never harm."]],[3239,["If you try to love anybody who is very","cruel and very bad,"]],[3245,["gradually he will calm down. He will harm","you little bit, he will do this,"]],[3251,["he will see things and he might be mean","with you, do all kinds of things."]],[3256,["But then, gradually you find your love","works, and works, and works."]],[3261,["And ultimately it is your love, which is","important to that person."]],[3266,["Now, your love is really firstly","appreciated"]],[3273,["more by innocent people, like children.","Children know what love is."]],[3278,["If the children see you, and they run away,","that means something wrong with you."]],[3286,["I’ve seen people… like once we were","in Japan"]],[3290,["and there were two foreigners who were","there, ladies, who were dressed up -"]],[3295,["I don't know from which hair-dresser they","had dressed up themselves"]],[3298,["and they were very much overly decorated -","and they came with us, you see."]],[3305,["We climbed up a place to see something","and when we came down"]],[3313,["there were some children standing there.","They had gone before us. So they said,"]],[3319,["\"Where are those witches?” I said, “Which?”","“Which went with you?\""]],[3323,["I said, \"What do you mean?\" \"They came,","you know, we were frightened,"]],[3327,["we ran away to our houses. Now we have","come to tell you they are witches.\""]],[3331,["These small, small little Japanese","children, you know,"]],[3334,["\"They are witches, you know, they are","witches. Be afraid of them.\""]],[3336,["And they had decorated themselves so much,","so much hair-dressed up."]],[3341,["They have tried to make such a beautiful","show of themselves,"]],[3345,["but the… for the children, they were","witches and they ran away."]],[3349,["And when we came, they came running and","telling us, “Don't be with them,"]],[3352,["they're witches.”"]],[3355,["So, the judgment of the innocent people","is the best judgment."]],[3360,["If they are innocent, they are extremely","well equipped"]],[3364,["to judge a person - who has love and who","does not have."]],[3368,["And they are the best people because they","will appreciate you the best."]],[3373,["They will understand that these are people","of some high quality."]],[3378,["But if they are not innocent, cunning,","some people are extremely cunning -"]],[3385,["that’s the intelligence part of it - they","can never appreciate you."]],[3389,["They'll appreciate something which is,","something very, very abnormal,"]],[3396,["which from divine part, divine angle,"]],[3402,["is very, very abtuse and funny. But they","will never appreciate you."]],[3412,["Never, cannot. Up to a point they may,","but may not."]],[3415,["Doesn't matter. You have to appreciate","yourself."]],[3420,["You have to know that you are not unkind","to anyone, you are not judging others,"]],[3426,["and that you are appreciating everything","in that person -"]],[3433,["whatever is good in him as a human being.","It works."]],[3438,["You have seen, this all has worked through","My love and compassion."]],[3443,["But I’m not conscious that I’m giving you","love or compassion or anything."]],[3448,["I’m not conscious even that I am giving you","anything."]],[3451,["I’m not even conscious as to… I have","created such a lot of beautiful people."]],[3459,["I am not conscious of that. It’s just","happening."]],[3462,["Just like this tree is here, see, it is","not conscious"]],[3466,["as to what it is and what it looks like.","It’s just is there."]],[3472,["In the same way, if it happens to you,","I tell you, you become really"]],[3478,["the source of such a joy for everyone."]],[3483,["Now, what do we have to do for this world?","What is needed to be done for this world?"]],[3489,["People talk of peace, this, that. There’s","no need to do anything."]],[3493,["It just… you become a personality of that","kind -"]],[3498,["you emit peace, you emit love, you emit joy","to others."]],[3504,["Now, this power is within you because it is","built-in, it's within you."]],[3508,["It is in a potential form in every person.","Only thing, it has to be brought out."]],[3514,["Now, with affection, you may not, but with","love and feeling that is innate within you."]],[3527,["Because there are no words for such subtle","things that are within yourself."]],[3532,["Because so far people don’t know what are","these things"]],[3535,["that make you feel oneness with others."]],[3539,["All this, all this can happen to you very","easily, very easily,"]],[3547,["when you understand that you are not this","mind, you are not this body,"]],[3554,["you are not this attention - you are","the Spirit."]],[3562,["Then you introspect, \"Am I the Spirit?","All right, if I am the Spirit,"]],[3566,["what is… what am I doing?\""]],[3572,["Once you become the Spirit, then you feel,","\"Why not others?\""]],[3576,["Out of love and compassion. Not for","becoming some leaders or anything."]],[3581,["Just out of love. \"If I am that why not","make others like that?\""]],[3585,["And that is how Sahaja Yoga has spread","so much,"]],[3588,["and we have such gems of people, such","beautiful people"]],[3593,["that I really never expected so much","to happen in My lifetime."]],[3598,["It has never happened with any saint, any","incarnation, any prophet."]],[3604,["So now, you people have become absolutely"]],[3608,["‘Khalis’ means absolutely you have vacated","yourself fully."]],[3613,["The story of Radha and Krishna is very","beautiful"]],[3617,["where Radha said that, \"Why do You take","this..."]],[3629,["[Hindi: \"I don’t know the English word","for Murli’\"],"]],[3632,["flute... to Your throat? Why do You take","this?\""]],[3635,["Because Murli is such a sweet thing, ‘na’,","flute is not so sweet."]],[3639,["\"But why do You take this flute to Your","lips?\""]],[3644,["After all… She, She must have been jealous,","I think so."]],[3649,["So, it's a story, just a story. So, He","said, \"Why not go and ask the flute?\""]],[3656,["So, flute She went and asked, \"Why","Shri Krishna"]],[3660,["takes you to His lips all the time?\""]],[3663,["So, he said, she said, \"You know,"]],[3667,["I have become completely hollow. There’s","nothing in me."]],[3673,["He puts me to His lips and people say","that I am playing the tune."]],[3680,["It’s He who is playing the tune. Where","am I? I’m not there."]],[3686,["I’m just enjoying the same tune, which is","passing through me."]],[3693,["That is the expression.\" But then Radha","told Shri Krishna,"]],[3698,["\"Why don't You make (me) the same way","as the flute?\""]],[3702,["So, this is what you have to be, the flute,","means you have to be hollow within yourself."]],[3708,["All these little, little things, you know,","which come into your life are not important."]],[3715,["What is important is - have you become","completely hollow?"]],[3721,["This is where, I would say, introspection","will help."]],[3725,["The one who makes the flute is also within","you."]],[3730,["So let there be a flute made out of you","by yourself only."]],[3738,["This is the way you make yourself what you","have to become."]],[3744,["In Gita Shri Krishna has said, \"Atmaneva","Atmane Shrushta\","]],[3749,["means the Spirit gets satisfied by itself."]],[3753,["Isn't it very difficult thing to","understand -"]],[3757,["how can the Spirit be satisfied by itself?"]],[3760,["But now you can understand what","Shri Krishna has said"]],[3764,["that your own Spirit becomes satisfied with","itself."]],[3770,["Then it doesn't require any other","satisfaction."]],[3773,["You seek the comfort of your Spirit, you","seek the joy of your Spirit,"]],[3777,["you seek the beauty of your Spirit."]],[3781,["You don't even seek, but it is in itself","is filled with that joy of the Spirit"]],[3791,["and it only can be satisfied by itself."]],[3796,["There are many people who say, \"I am not","satisfied, you see,"]],[3799,["this I am not very much satisfied, it is","not that I am satisfied.\""]],[3805,["In the same way, the Spirit can say,","\"I am not satisfied.\""]],[3811,["But the Spirit can be satisfied with Spirit","only."]],[3817,["It’s like the reflection in the mirror.","When you look at the mirror you see there"]],[3823,["your own reflection. Now, if the mirror is","not all right, I will say,"]],[3828,["\"I am not satisfied with what reflection","we are getting out of this mirror.\""]],[3832,["So you’ll change the mirror, you’ll bring","the better mirror,"]],[3835,["you'll try to get a better picture","of yourself. In the same way,"]],[3840,["the Spirit which is reflected within you,","wants to see its own image."]],[3847,["And then what you do is to… you go on,","somehow or other,"]],[3852,["changing, cleaning, making it all right","through your meditation"]],[3860,["so that your Spirit is satisfied with","the Spirit."]],[3865,["Shri Krishna wrote Gita in such a ambiguous","manner because He was very clever."]],[3869,["He knew human beings cannot take things","straight,"]],[3871,["so tell them this way, that way, that way,"]],[3873,["so that they’ll run around and then","ultimately they will come to Truth."]],[3878,["But Truth is very simple. Truth is","extremely simple."]],[3883,["You don't have to go here and there and","you don't have to stand on your legs"]],[3887,["or feet all the time. You don't have","to fight with anything."]],[3892,["You don't have to take to some sort of","a ‘tapasya’, abstinence - nothing."]],[3899,["Only just you become like a flute. You","become hollow."]],[3908,["It’s not difficult. It’s not difficult","at all for Sahaja Yogis"]],[3913,["because already the Kundalini has made","you hollow. It’s not difficult."]],[3917,["But still, I find people deviate. Their","attention goes here and there."]],[3924,["So many people have told Me how their","problems were solved"]],[3927,["without doing anything about it. I said,","\"What did you do?\""]],[3931,["\"No, Mother, we just put it at Your lotus","feet.\" I said, \"Really?\""]],[3937,["\"Yes, that's all. Or we were just looking","at the problem, what the problem is."]],[3941,["We were standing outside and looking","at the problem and the problem got solved.\""]],[3946,["Even the most difficult problems that you","think, can be solved"]],[3950,["very easily because you have powers. Your","powers are great."]],[3958,["You are saints, but more than saints,"]],[3963,["much more than saints because you are born","at such a volatile times."]],[3970,["Like supposing, you have a light in","darkness, you are finding something,"]],[3976,["you bump into that and you bump into that."]],[3980,["But supposing, this is a place full of gas,"]],[3986,["you bring one light, the whole thing becomes","enlightened. Like that you have powers."]],[3993,["But you must get out of this nonsense","of \"me\", \"my\" and \"mine\"."]],[4003,["I don't know how to say you get out -","It’s not like a swimming pool,"]],[4007,["that you jump into it and get out. It’s not","like that."]],[4011,["It is another kind of a very subtle","understanding that our roots have to grow."]],[4020,["And for growing our roots, we have to go","within ourselves"]],[4024,["and find out within ourselves what is","the area we are occupying,"]],[4032,["in what areas in our lifestyle we are","taking these roots inside."]],[4040,["Also, Shri Krishna has said that the tree","of life has the roots in the brain"]],[4046,["and grows downward. It’s very interesting","to understand"]],[4050,["that the roots are growing in the brain."]],[4054,["That means, your own intellect is just","covered with compassion,"]],[4062,["it’s just being absolutely one with","compassion."]],[4074,["I had told you a story about a saint"]],[4077,["who was to take to… water for the Deity","n Gujarat"]],[4081,["and he walked one month to go there with","a pitcher of water."]],[4089,["And then at the… because it was a very","high mountain on which this Deity was,"]],[4097,["and he reached at the foothill."]],[4102,["There he found a little donkey dying","of thirst"]],[4108,["so he poured all the water for that donkey."]],[4113,["So those who were with him, they asked,","\"What are you doing?"]],[4115,["You brought it all the way, and why are","you putting it for this donkey?\""]],[4119,["He said, \"You don't know?"]],[4120,["The God has come all the way down, just","to meet me here."]],[4124,["He doesn't want me to climb up.\""]],[4127,["This kind of an absolutely simple","understanding"]],[4135,["of another's feelings and another's","problems:"]],[4143,["you can solve them, you can sort them out."]],[4148,["And the person will tell you that, \"You","sorted out my problem.\""]],[4151,["But you will not know how you have solved","because this love is the power."]],[4157,["This love can see things. It is everything."]],[4161,["It’s like a… you see a television,","all right, it’s a television."]],[4165,["If you see a telephone, it's a telephone."]],[4167,["If you see anything you do with the power,","it’s all is embodied inside this love."]],[4176,["You need not have to telephone. I never","telephone to anyone."]],[4181,["Mostly I never telephone. I mean, if","somebody forces Me then it’s all right."]],[4185,["I never telephone. But not to save","the bill,"]],[4188,["but I do not telephone because there is","no need."]],[4192,["The whole subtle of the ether is at your","feet."]],[4197,["Just you want to do something you can just","do it, just with the vibrations."]],[4203,["Now, many people say, \"Mother, cure this","person, cure that person.\" There’s no need."]],[4209,["You all can cure, you are so many. You can","cure anyone you want to,"]],[4215,["but you bring that person to Me. It’s not","needed."]],[4218,["Just you can cure anybody you feel like."]],[4221,["You can solve all their problems yourself.","One little Bandhan can solve it."]],[4227,["But for that you should be the source","of love."]],[4231,["Once you give a Bandhan, the… this powerful","love takes over,"]],[4240,["\"All right, I'll do the job.\""]],[4245,["But for that you have to be the master","of this beautiful thing."]],[4249,["Now, one thing is very different from other","masteries."]],[4254,["In other masteries, you see people try","to dominate"]],[4258,["or to, try to use it for destroying others."]],[4264,["But the mastery of love is that you know","how to build"]],[4273,["a rapport with the Divine love. And this","Divine love is not only powerful,"]],[4282,["but it is such a efficient, I should say,","such an alert instrument"]],[4294,["which works out everything in such a manner"]],[4297,["that you are amazed how things have worked","out."]],[4302,["And everybody has noticed it. I know you","all know it."]],[4306,["Not that you don't know, but you don't use."]],[4308,["You have to be on the vibratory awareness","and use that."]],[4313,["Even giving yourself is a Bandhan itself","clarifies you."]],[4317,["Imagine in your hand there is this great","power of giving you this balance,"]],[4325,["this love, this affection and all","the protection"]],[4329,["while you can give it to others also. You","have become now"]],[4334,["the part and parcel of the Divine power.","You are now in the Kingdom of God."]],[4339,["And whatever you want to do can be done","by this divine power."]],[4344,["With all this telling you I still feel,","sometimes, you are not confident."]],[4349,["You get upset. You feel that, \"How can","this be?\""]],[4356,["You have no trust in yourself, you have no","faith in yourself."]],[4360,["And also there are some people, sort of,","who feel they are neglected,"]],[4367,["or something should have happened to them."]],[4371,["Once a lady started crying. So, I said,","\"Why is she crying?\""]],[4376,["She said, \"Because Mother didn't smile","at me.\" I didn’t smile at her?"]],[4382,["But I never smiled at anyone. I don't know","why she thinks like that."]],[4387,["So, I asked her, \"Why do you want Me","to smile at you? What's wrong with you?"]],[4394,["You are all right? Why should I smile","at you?\""]],[4397,["So, you see, also this kind of a feeling"]],[4400,["that comes up sometimes that in Sahaja","Yoga,"]],[4403,["Mother should all the time be only attached","to you."]],[4408,["She cannot get attached, you know.","It’s a helpless condition I have."]],[4413,["There are so many, you don't know, defects","I have, which you have no idea."]],[4418,["I don't know how to count money."]],[4420,["If I… give Me hundred rupees I’ll count it","two hundred rupees."]],[4423,["You see, I don't know many things. I don't","know banking;"]],[4426,["I don't know many things and one of them","is I don't know"]],[4430,["how to put attention to this person or","to that person. Like politicians would do -"]],[4436,["\"You see, ah, you must look after this man,","because he is very important.\" Nothing."]],[4441,["To Me you are just part and parcel of Me,","finished, nothing more than that."]],[4447,["So, you see, everybody so should know that","you are very close to My heart,"]],[4453,["you are very much there, I am very proud","of you. And something,"]],[4458,["really it’s a miracle that has happened,","that you people have taken to Sahaja Yoga."]],[4464,["So on that point also, that how much Mother","cares for me, what She does..."]],[4469,["Now supposing, I tell somebody, \"All right,","you don't sit here, sit there,\""]],[4471,["they feel bad. Anything you do, they feel","bad."]],[4475,["This kind of a person has no sense of love.","He doesn't understand Mother's love."]],[4481,["So, at the end of the whole thing I must","tell you,"]],[4484,["that when you are a guru, you are also","a mother."]],[4489,["You have to express yourself like a mother.","She is kind, she is gentle, she forgives."]],[4495,["She also corrects whenever it’s necessary,","but in her own sweet way she corrects"]],[4500,["so the correction takes place - it's not","that a rebellion starts."]],[4504,["So all that wisdom of a mother is within","you, is already there, so please try to use."]],[4511,["I am sure, it will all work out and as it","is we are a very beautiful group of people"]],[4517,["who are something out of the blue, who are","so much in peace and in joy together."]],[4529,["May God bless you all."]],[4541,["So, today's Guru Puja will be..."]],[4545,["Of course, we can - we can have a little","of Ganesha's Atharva Sheersha,"]],[4550,["but Devi Puja will be much less."]],[4553,["And for Guru Puja I would request","the country leaders to come up."]],[4559,["Country leaders have to come up. So it is","in a different way,"]],[4564,["we can say that the main thing is","the Guru Puja"]],[4568,["where the country leaders have to come up."]],[4571,["The Devi Puja will be followed after that,","which is very short."]],[4578,["(Hindi: \"Please, change this tea.\")"]]]);
